<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe September CPI inflation rises to 20.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe September CPI inflation rises to 20.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's all-items consumer price index rose 4.7 percent in September from August, bringing the year-on-year rate to 20.6 percent, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p>				    Sept 1996   Aug 1996    Sept 1995</p>
<p>Year-on-year pct change	20.6	  17.7	  23.0</p>
<p>All-items index		 427.1	 407.9	 354.1</p>
<p>Food-only index		 568.1	 538.9	 458.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Index base 1990=100</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9</p>
</text>
